==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Galactic Overseer Nyandam]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Nimoy Bore]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**4 [[LeMurr]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**1 [[Calamary]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Do not do this stage until you have fully cleared Into the Future.

Once you have your Crystals, this just becomes [[Floating Continent (Into the Future)|Floating Continent]] on a budget. Spam units like [[Seafarer Cat]] for the Nimoy Bores and run units with high damage like [[Can Can Cat]] and [[Drama Cats]] so that you don't have to fight two Nimoy Bores at once and you win.

